{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"᥈ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ","commonName":"᥈ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ","title":"ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ᤺ᤴ ᤜᤠᤰᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤏᤡᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"9e76648f9bca2375f88920d323e178cdb2e0317a340e6114719058916d4d4896","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":81},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤀᤡᤖᤧ ᤂᤥ᤺ᤵᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤁᤢᤎᤰᤛᤢᤒᤠᤴ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤠᤛ᤻ᤛᤠ᤺ᤀᤣ. ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ᤃ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤀᤥ ᤁᤧᤘᤠ᤹ᤒᤠ ᤗᤢᤱᤃᤢᤶᤗᤠᤶᤒᤠ ᤁᤧᤎᤢᤶᤒᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤋᤥ᤺ᤴᤍᤡᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤋᤃᤡ ᤁᤧᤄᤧᤵᤛᤢᤒᤠ ᤀᤠᤒᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤁᤧᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤀᤡᤖᤧ ᤂᤥ᤺ᤵᤋᤢᤛᤡᤒᤠ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤜᤢ᤹ᤔᤠ ᤁᤧᤛᤢᤰᤐᤠ ᤏᤛᤠ᤺ᤴᤛᤠᤒᤠ ᤘᤣ᤹ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤜᤢᤰᤛᤢᤵᤋᤧᤛᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠᤀᤣᤒᤠ ᤁᤢᤎᤰᤛᤢᤒᤠ ᤁᤢᤀᤡᤛᤡ᤺ᤰ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ ᤀᤠᤏᤡᤃᤧᤏᤢ ᤋᤢᤰᤂᤣ ᤆᤠᤔᤠᤀᤥ ᤆᤢᤶ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤌᤰᤛᤢᤒᤠ ᤋᤢᤖᤠᤀᤥ ᤁᤧᤕᤠᤰᤐᤠ ᤀᤠᤳᤋᤡᤴ ᤌᤰᤛᤢᤒᤠᤴᤏᤠᤱ ᤜᤡᤶ ᤕᤠ᤺ᤶᤒᤰᤁᤥ ᤔᤧᤜᤶᤛᤡᤱᤅᤡᤴ. ᤁᤖ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧᤃ ᤂᤢᤏᤧ᤹ ᤁᤢᤎᤰᤋᤢᤶᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤋᤠ᤺ᤔᤠ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤆᤥᤃᤢ᤹ᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤜᤰᤆᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤥ ᤁᤧᤗᤥ᤺ᤰᤐᤧᤴ ᤜᤰᤆᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤥᤒᤠ ᤌᤡᤶᤜᤠ᤹ ᤁᤢᤀᤡᤛᤡ᤺ᤰ ᤔᤧᤗᤥ᤺ᤰᤏᤧᤴᤏᤧ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤃᤪ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤌᤢᤶᤄᤥ ᤔᤧᤄᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤴᤗᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["ᤕᤠᤶᤒᤢᤎᤡᤰᤁᤠᤱ ᤕᤠ᤺ᤴᤃᤧᤔ᤺ᤒᤠ ᤔᤏᤠ᤺ᤸᤗᤧᤀᤣ ᤁᤧᤍᤢᤶᤒᤠ ᤆᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤠᤰᤏᤢ ᤋᤃᤡ ᤂᤢᤏᤧ᤹ᤀᤣ ᤆᤠᤔᤠ ᤂᤥ᤺ᤔᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤗᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[